            "review_title": "Review at An Com Uong Nuoc Thai Bistro & Coffee - Kin Khao Kin Nam",
            "review_text": "Wendy Nguyen\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam41 contributions\n0\nAbsolutely amazing\nMay 2020 • Family\nFirst of all, this place is real cool. Cozy, great ambience. We ordered about 6 dishes: Pad thai, tom yum, salad, fried rice with egg, grilled pork and deep fried pork. My fav is pad thai with shrimp, this one was just perfect. The portion is quite small, so you can try a lot of different dishes. The staff were very attentive and friendly. All in all, I really like this place. Definitely will be back.\nRead more\nWritten May 21, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
