            "review_text": "Ngân Hà\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam6 contributions\n0\nOne of my fav Thai cuisine restaurant ever!\nJul 2019 • Friends\nI’ve gone to Kin-khao, Kin-nam restaurant twice but I really like it from the simple and friendly decoration to the Thai dishes which are so tasty with the season of Vietnamese. The most mouthwatering dish to me is the Julienne mango & catfish salad. The waiters are very enthusiastic, although the location was a little difficult to find for me but because I like Thai food and like Mr. Đại (the co-founder of this restaurant) so I tried to find it out. In short, it is one of my favorite Thai restaurants in Saigon !!! 👍\nRead more\nWritten July 13, 2019",
